        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_366,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_608,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_758 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "DIFFERENT EXPERIENCES, DIFFERENT REACTIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2356bef32e52c240cd08419a3dcd76f2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Imagine the alternate result if only delusion were operating. Perhaps that situation would become exaggerated. We have to recognize things for what they are. If the mind has a bad habit, we have to recognize that. There is awareness so you're keenly aware of what goes through your mind. It takes time and everybody has different characteristics. We all have faults and we need to look at what is in our mind and know it until the mind realizes that it doesn't want to be that way anymore. That realization will help you learn how to let go."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1183 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1184,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_34,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_463,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_533,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_878 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "DIFFERENT EXPERIENCES, DIFFERENT REACTIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "983098e55edde46e08173b40251d5cc2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "We think that there are many people that we interact with in our daily lives. In fact, most of us will usually interact with a certain limited set of people over and over again. How do we work with this? How can we strategize so that we become skillful? So long as there is the intention to have the Dhamma in our lives, then it will become easier."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1185 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1186,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1187,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1188,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1189,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_208,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_796,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_974 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "DIFFERENT EXPERIENCES, DIFFERENT REACTIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c40bc3baeea157cc46b650afc176e723"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Having these experiences is very important and each experience gives you a life lesson. It's like playing videogames, which I like to talk about with children. You work at it and reach the first level. You graduate to higher and higher levels and eventually win the prize. You know how to do this because you've got that experience. You know how you can win this game at this level. Of course if you don't know how to learn from your experiences, you won't get anything no matter how many life lessons come your way!"^^xsd:string .

