        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_223,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_23,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_86 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Lighter Approach"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9e6ba1c6589ed40486759f170410e44b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "When I began to meditate in earnest at home, my awareness was inconsistent. I over-compensated for this spotty awareness by putting in a lot more personal effort. I wanted to be as mindful as possible but I was just too tired to do any more than that. Even then, there was only so much I could do. After some time, I began to notice a lighter, general, but discontinuous awareness that, done day after day, formed a pattern of long-term practice. The momentum that came out of general awareness created these dots that came together to form a tsunami of awareness that could be seen clearly."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1213 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1203,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1208,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1214,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1215,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_1216,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_176,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_647,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_86,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_972 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Lighter Approach"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "06e941f67873f904bf1e67d4ac8faee4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "We do not believe gentle awareness will work or trust that it will grow into something so we are not patient with gentle awareness. Personal effort uses our own effort while waiting patiently for momentum to grow uses a natural process, a natural law, and natural energy. Unfortunately, personal effort is short-lived and does not allow us to function in the day-to-day. We then begin to doubt our ability to live our lives with awareness."^^xsd:string .

