    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "MAINTAINING A STABLE MIND"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "91da79efbca35e241dc5b1519b85f123"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "I kept an eye on the peacefulness and on whether it was being maintained or disturbed with whatever contact there was with external or internal experiences. When you are aware of a peaceful mind, it continues to be peaceful. It becomes more and more peaceful. When you aren't aware of the peaceful mind then the mind starts breaking down into chaos."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_513 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_204,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_96 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "MAINTAINING A STABLE MIND"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ad86f79ef384c06f2e1f4a28b06dfd90"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "How long can you maintain stability of mind in daily life?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_514 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_327,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_437,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_460,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_515,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_516,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_517,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_518,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "MAINTAINING A STABLE MIND"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c54241467de5cafd6f2a4422cc9da471"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The Buddha said that when there are leaves covering the surface of a lake, you can't see your reflection. Also when the water is turbulent, you can't see your reflection. It is the same with the mind. Stability and wisdom cannot arise when the mind is covered with defilements."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_519 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_204,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_520,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_521,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_522,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_523,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_524,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "MAINTAINING A STABLE MIND"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "78f6880a9a5e5710bec83d683d701458"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "We give wisdom more opportunities to arise when awareness and stability of mind are present for longer and longer periods. Once you recognize the agitated mind and continue to know that agitated mind, it starts to become peaceful and clear again. Not being aware of the agitation or confusion only leads it to spiral into more agitation or confusion. When you know the peaceful mind continuously and you know everything that's happening in the mind, you'll also immediately notice when a speck of defilement comes to disturb that peace. At this point, you can immediately recognize the thought that preceded that shift from a peaceful mind to an agitated mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_525 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_341,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_526,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_527,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_528,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_529,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_530,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_531,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "MAINTAINING A STABLE MIND"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dac923347955b27e73f685d79811c167"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "Sometimes, even if you're not watching a lot of objects, you can know the main object, which is the state of your mind. When you know the state of your mind, you also know the feeling, body, and mind simultaneously so there is no need to go after many objects. Instead, just know the state of your mind--whether it is peaceful or agitated. Keep that as your anchor as you know everything else and as you go about your business."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_532 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_246,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_39,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_45,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_533,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_68,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_96 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "MAINTAINING A STABLE MIND"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "887f334e45774932db2cf7cc9809c547"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "Yogis want to improve the quality of the mind but if you haven't seen the mind, the mind cannot change! In daily life, you may put in a lot of effort into your work with little energy left for awareness and awareness needs some energy as well. If you are not skillful at using just enough energy for awareness, you'll use too much energy and won't have enough to do normal work. Learn to use just enough energy, and then practice continuously. You will become skillful if you do this every day."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_534 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_177,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_442,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_535,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_536,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "BECOMING ENERGIZED"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "20a488fdef4175eb5283ea746591085f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "It's very important to know the meditating mind that is at work because it allows us to see cause and effect and also helps us to continue doing the work. It strengthens and energizes the mind. Even when we observe that awareness is present, we must also be clear about the object it is knowing. Both must be clear in order to have a complete picture of the workings of awareness in the present moment and thus for wisdom to arise."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_537 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_204,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_349,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_366,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_437,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_45,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_538,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "HOW DO WE MAKE INROADS?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6d0eb0360e99bf12aa8cc0076004dae2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "For most of us, awareness + wisdom are not ready and on standby so defilements are allowed to arise over and over. It's a vicious cycle: we can't get peace; then we can't make inroads into the practice; so we can't get peace. Even if we forget about wisdom for a while, we are not even able to really continuously maintain just awareness and stability of mind in our lives."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_539 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_540,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_541,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_542,
