    neo:h3 "HOW DO WE MAKE INROADS?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "205099106c98dbeb3657798ff2006ff4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Skill and understanding of how to do right practice is very important. When we become skillful at observing all six of the sense doors and really have a handle on it, that's when we find ourselves confident about practicing at home in our lives. We don't know what circumstances are going to come up and we can't predict what people or situations are going to hit us."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_573 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_223,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_23,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_45,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_574,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_575,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_576,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_577,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_578,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_579,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_580 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "HOW DO WE MAKE INROADS?"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "59c194c945001c74ccdb23f315fb2d86"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "I would liken mindfulness to a mother tending to a baby. Having children is a huge enterprise, as all mothers will know. I once observed a mother caring for her two-year-old and saw just how skillful she was with the toddler as he sat on her lap. She held a conversation with four other people while feeding the child. As the toddler moved in her lap, she adjusted along with him, and every now and then gave him some food, and if he didn't like what she gave him, she would put the piece down and give him a different piece and later on pick up the original piece again to give the child. Sometimes she would eat it herself, always going with the flow, not making judgments of the child. Meditation is like this. We may find it difficult in the beginning to mind what we are doing and be mindful as well but it's all practice and habits."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_581 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_115,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_202,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_204,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_210,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_223,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_582,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_583,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_584,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_585,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_96 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "810740c0907802a3c893a11bdb247f85"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "If thoughts are too subtle, and you don't catch the thoughts, then the causes will not show themselves. So there can be awareness and stability of mind, but wisdom is missing from the picture. There needs to be a little bit of inquiry. First, we are mindful of what is happening as we move around in daily life. Then, later on, we'll begin to notice why our limbs are moving like that. There's a reason behind it. Whether it's action, speech or mind, there's some kind of idea behind these actions. There is no speech or action without some idea fueling it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_586 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_167,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_202,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_341,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_587,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_588,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_589,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_590 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3d53f3c3bb30f51cc12494fde6791b00"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Why are you wearing the shirt you are wearing right now? Why did you place your keys, for example, over here, instead of in the corner somewhere? There are ideas in the mind. Notice what is happening. If you are at the point where you can be aware of the mind, begin to pay attention to how it is feeling or what it is thinking. You will then begin to see causes. The mind is knowing, aware and feeling. Pay attention to the mind that wants to do things or that wants something to happen."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_591 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_272,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_482,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_527,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_592,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_593,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_594,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_595,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_596,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_597,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_598 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c3d6c8312a66aff467cbe9e8623f4276"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "These mental intentions are present everywhere in the body. What intentions are you aware of while you are walking? What are you aware of when you are sitting? What are you aware of when you are working? Do you notice the wanting to move? What do you want to move? Every movement involves mental intentions. If you're moving both arms, there are intentions involved in both of them. You can see these things if you're watching the mind. What are you aware of while you're reading this? If you only watch the body, you will not see a complete picture. When you begin to see a more comprehensive picture of how the mind and body are operating, then you will also come to see causes and effects and it becomes very interesting."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_599 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_18,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_204,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_293,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_437,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_49,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_524,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_536,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_600,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_601,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e1bd076970ea360c7b47a3b20370d511"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Defilements can still enter any time if there is awareness and stability of mind but no wisdom. So, even with the first two present, a little wrong turn in attitude can let in defilements! Fear can arise in just one thought. When you see one complete process, it will also be very clear that there's no need to go around in circles. The mind understands that because of this thought, this effect of fear happens. A yogi who pays attention to the way these causes and effects work will come to own this knowledge of cause and effect."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_602 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_221,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_349,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_603,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_604,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_605 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cb9b0a5f94dec2addfb5cdf557a4b060"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:text "When I was trying to understand the emotion of anger, I asked myself whether I was happy or at peace when there was anger. Why was there anger? What was I angry with? When the mind is angry at something, there is some sort of underlying idea in there. The mind is holding onto a certain belief and getting angry over it. As soon as I saw this happening in the mind, the anger just slid away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_606 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_297,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_463,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_603,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_607,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_608 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e63473ec69d45a2ba52bcd6445edea48"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Sometimes people don't even have an idea of what they're angry about. So many things have accumulated over time that it's hard to pull apart the strands. It's all jumbled up. I sometimes ask people why they're unhappy and they don't even know."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_609 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_214,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_341,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_366,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_603,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_610,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_611,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_612 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "011263f5c000f0a48d06702b577a37e5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "You have to watch every time anger arises. This anger wasn't here a moment ago. Look at this feeling very closely. It has something to do with the conditions surrounding your experience at this moment because the mind has certain presumptions about these conditions. Is it a person? Is it something in the environment? Is it you?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_61 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_50,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_56,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_62,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_63,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_64,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_65 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5706c8d0ffdd3ff9eeaacf01d1f38449"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Sayadaw is a strong proponent of applying the Buddha's teachings to daily activities in a monastery, at home, and at work. When his long- time disciples make the migration to the Shwe Oo Min Dhamma Sukha Tawya Meditation Center in Yangon, Myanmar, one of his first questions is typically about their practice. Some may reply in detail while others sheepishly answer that they have returned to jumpstart their flagging practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_613 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_177,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_39,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_411,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_463,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_603,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_614,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_615,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_616,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_617,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_67 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9cbe419b9a5a3f0da479bd7d25c3602a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:text "For example, people feel that they shouldn't get angry when they're on retreat. Anger arises anyway. Now they're angry that there's anger! This is possible! Yogis then get frustrated. Sometimes the mind may be in a habit of getting angry at something specific so when this object appears, anger will arise. If you're able to understand this as a natural phenomenon, then the anger will go down in intensity immediately. How is that? It's because there is now Right Understanding."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_618 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_168,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_294,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_603,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_617,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_619,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_620 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9181f52c0bb4a8f8a722112327074bb4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:text "You want to watch and learn what and why something is happening. You want to know why anger is present. Why does this feeling arise? Maybe you are dissatisfied. Why are you dissatisfied? You want certain things to happen. Let's say you don't get what you want or what you want to happen does not happen. You want something. Can you just watch this anger? It's impossible. The anger is going to keep on going. Why? Because there's some cause that you have not addressed yet. If you want to know the intensity of the anger, you can look to the intensity of the wanting. They are related."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_621 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_523,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_54,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_603,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_622 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Mindfulness is a Lifestyle Change"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "INQUIRY AS A PART OF PRACTICE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "508b40da94206a01644df937a30bedc9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:text "When you have some preconceived notions about something and things don't turn out the way you wanted them to, anger will arise. Or you may feel justified in being angry over something. You may be relating an event back to a friend and you might say, \"You know I really ought to be angry about so and so...\" What does this mean? It's just the mind preparing itself to let this defilement loose. But it's never good to let anger loose."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_623 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_624,
