        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_916,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_917,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_918 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d941975ba6a07a5e55539f34de88e9a3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:text "The mind seeks variety, novelty and freshness and becomes lazy or bored when it's not satiated. If we think that a certain experience is lingering longer than we'd like, we're not observing properly. No two moments are the same. Every moment is fresh and every moment is changing. Even if an experience may seem neutral, we can still see subtle changes."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_919 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_223,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_39,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_390,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_419,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_69,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_920,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_921 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "DOING WHAT SHOULD BE DONE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "86591fc341f44a050c0844ca5475ca2d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Yogis usually know about the Five Precepts and Eight Precepts so I do not need to tell them to you. If there is always mindfulness, you will automatically follow the Five Precepts. We must have some idea about what the Five Precepts entail in order to maintain them. It's important to have that kind of knowledge already, but I'm not the sort of person who wants to impose requirements on people. If you merely follow my instructions without conducting your own investigation, wisdom won't arise in you. You need to learn to the point where you personally understand why you need to act in certain ways."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_922 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_390,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_455,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_62,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_920,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_923,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_924,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_925,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_926,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_927,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_928 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "DOING WHAT SHOULD BE DONE"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "549e72c675d4907d4f393d232b3c8627"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:text "There are two aspects of sila or moral conduct: the doing of what should be done, and the not doing of what should not be done. If you know the Patimokkha (the Buddhist monastic code), the Buddha says to do good, avoid evil, and purify the mind. The Buddha says to do what should be done. The Five and Eight Precepts that we always talk about is abstaining from that which should not be done. Remember that there is also the other side: do as much as possible of what should be done."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_929 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_223,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_224,
        ex:node_4_2970e5b0_c019_4056_86a0_f3b0ab208a9b_23,
